    <string name="irctc_rules_tips_title">Official IRCTC Booking Rules &amp; Tips</string>
    <string name="irctc_tip_1">• General Quota ARP: Advance Reservation Period opens 60 days before travel at exactly 8:00 AM IST.</string>
    <string name="irctc_tip_2">• AC Tatkal Quota: Opens 1 day before journey date at 10:00 AM IST (1A, 2A, 3A, CC, EC, 3E).</string>
    <string name="irctc_tip_3">• Sleeper (SL) Tatkal Quota: Opens 1 day before journey date at 11:00 AM IST (SL, 2S).</string>
    <string name="irctc_tip_4">• Pro-tip: Log into your IRCTC Rail Connect App or website 5 minutes early, keep master list saved, and use UPI/e-Wallet for rapid checkout.</string>

